supermox-manager (10.26.4) supermox; urgency=medium

  * Create container offers only templates for the node's own architecture.
    The appliance index is multi-architecture, and a container made from a
    foreign template can never start (its /sbin/init cannot execute). ops.containers
    maps the node's current-kernel.machine to the Debian architecture name and
    available_templates() leaves out the other architectures; a template that
    names no architecture is still offered.

 -- SuperMox <noreply@supermox.me>  Thu, 05 Nov 2026 05:50:46 -0800

